    "code": " import sys\n\nimport bisect\n\nimport copy\n\ninput = sys.stdin.readline\n\n\n\nn,m=map(int,input().split())\n\nK=[0]+list(map(int,input().split()))\n\nSP=[list(map(int,input().split())) for i in range(m)]\n\n\n\nSP2=[[] for i in range(n+1)]\n\n\n\nfor d,t in SP:\n\n    SP2[t].append(d)\n\n\n\nfor i in range(n+1):\n\n    SP2[i].sort()\n\n\n\nSUM=sum(K)\n\nMIN=SUM\n\nMAX=SUM*2\n\nMAXBUY=0\n\n\n\nfor day in range(MIN,MAX+1):\n\n\n\n    DAYS=[[] for i in range(day+1)]\n\n\n\n    for i in range(n+1):\n\n        x=bisect.bisect_right(SP2[i],day)-1\n\n        if x>=0:\n\n            DAYS[SP2[i][x]].append(i)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    GOLD=0\n\n    BUY=0\n\n    K2=copy.deepcopy(K)\n\n\n\n    for d in range(1,day+1):\n\n        GOLD+=1\n\n\n\n        for t in DAYS[d]:\n\n            DBUY=min(K2[t],GOLD)\n\n            K2[t]-=DBUY\n\n            GOLD-=DBUY\n\n            BUY+=DBUY\n\n\n\n    MAXBUY=max(MAXBUY,BUY)\n\n\n\nprint(MAX-MAXBUY)\n\n\n\n\n\n        \n\n        \n",
